WEBVTT

00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:15.807
Meta-llicana is about to fall.

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:19.644
With just a little more time,
the second seal will be mine.

00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:20.562
Not to mention--

00:00:20.645 --> 00:00:22.564
Master Kall-Su! A crisis, my lord!

00:00:22.647 --> 00:00:23.481
What is it now?

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:26.443
The ninja fortress
in Grave Valley was destroyed.

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:28.903
Also, the ninja army
and Ninja Master Gara have…

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:30.113
What?

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:34.826
Has Gara defected
from the Four Divine Kings?

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.328
Unfortunately, it's true, sir.

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:40.165
I can't believe Gara
would betray us.

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:43.960
<i>Something must have happened</i>
<i>between him and Dark Schneider.</i>

00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:48.131
<i>I know Gara's a ninja,</i>
<i>but he's a warrior at heart.</i>

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:50.592
<i>In truth, he's a simple man.</i>

00:00:50.675 --> 00:00:54.596
<i>Is it possible that he fell</i>
<i>for Dark Schneider's deceitful tricks?</i>

00:00:54.679 --> 00:00:58.058
Deliver this message to the Third Army
as they attack Meta-llicana!

00:00:58.683 --> 00:01:02.062
One of the Four Divine Kings
is also an incredible swordsman.

00:01:02.145 --> 00:01:03.354
Arshes Nei.

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:06.983
Even her allies tremble in fear
at how merciless she is.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:10.153
She'd never fall for one
of Dark Schneider's dirty tricks.

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:13.573
If Dark Schneider has chosen
to undermine the Four Divine Kings,

00:01:13.656 --> 00:01:15.658
then he has chosen to die!

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:17.035
He is our enemy!

00:01:17.118 --> 00:01:19.496
So we'll kill him
before he grows stronger.

00:01:20.538 --> 00:01:22.332
Death is all that awaits him!

00:02:55.008 --> 00:02:56.759
DESTINY

00:02:56.843 --> 00:03:00.013
Let us show the world
our power and honor!

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:07.270
Your Highness, our army
is succeeding at keeping the enemy at bay.

00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:10.815
If this keeps up, I believe the enemy
will accept our proposal

00:03:10.899 --> 00:03:12.650
to begin peace negotiations.

00:03:12.734 --> 00:03:14.652
Mm-hmm.

00:03:15.236 --> 00:03:18.364
<i>We're up against Kall-Su</i>
<i>and the Dark Rebel Army here.</i>

00:03:18.448 --> 00:03:20.700
<i>A peaceful resolution is a fool's hope.</i>

00:03:20.783 --> 00:03:21.618
Hmm?

00:03:27.582 --> 00:03:29.918
What a powerful lightning strike.

00:03:30.001 --> 00:03:32.462
It's one of the Four Divine Kings.

00:03:35.173 --> 00:03:37.842
Empress Nei,
a messenger has arrived from Meta-llicana

00:03:37.926 --> 00:03:40.553
bearing a letter
that formally requests a peace talk.

00:03:40.637 --> 00:03:43.097
-Kill him and send back his body.
-Yes.

00:03:43.181 --> 00:03:46.851
I, Arshes Nei, the leader of
the Third Army of the Four Divine Kings,

00:03:46.935 --> 00:03:49.437
will not accept surrender from anyone.

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:52.607
If their people want to live,
they must defeat us.

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:55.276
If they lose, we will kill them all.

00:03:57.862 --> 00:03:59.739
Those are the rules of war.

00:03:59.822 --> 00:04:01.741
Have they forgotten so easily?

00:04:02.742 --> 00:04:03.952
As you wish.

00:04:04.035 --> 00:04:05.161
Empress Nei!

00:04:05.245 --> 00:04:07.247
A message from Lord Kall-Su!

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:08.623
From Kall-Su?

00:04:08.706 --> 00:04:11.376
He has issued an order
for us to kill Dark Schneider!

00:04:11.459 --> 00:04:13.127
Dark Schneider?

00:04:13.211 --> 00:04:15.338
The whispers of his resurrection are true!

00:04:15.421 --> 00:04:16.923
I knew it.

00:04:17.006 --> 00:04:20.301
What happened to Gara?
He was assigned to look into the rumor.

00:04:20.385 --> 00:04:22.136
Well… well, he…

00:04:28.601 --> 00:04:30.728
What do you mean "he defected"?

00:04:30.812 --> 00:04:34.107
The thousand-strong
ninja army led by Master Gara

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:37.193
disappeared into thin air
when the fortress was destroyed.

00:04:37.277 --> 00:04:40.113
Their whereabouts are currently unknown.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:42.949
<i> Gara,</i>
<i>what the hell are you doing?</i>

00:04:50.248 --> 00:04:51.457
<i>Dark Schneider.</i>

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:00.174
<i>Darsh.</i>

00:05:00.842 --> 00:05:03.845
<i>The time has finally come</i>
<i>for me to kill you…</i>

00:05:04.679 --> 00:05:06.639
<i>with my own hands!</i>

00:05:15.148 --> 00:05:16.274
What is this?

00:05:16.858 --> 00:05:18.234
Is this a dream?

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:20.445
Where am I?

00:05:21.946 --> 00:05:23.906
Wait. This place is--

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:25.867
You're right.

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:28.244
It's in this very place that we first met.

00:05:28.328 --> 00:05:29.412
Darsh!

00:05:30.079 --> 00:05:31.956
It's been so long, Arsh.

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:33.875
An Illusion spell.

00:05:34.375 --> 00:05:35.543
I should've known.

00:05:37.587 --> 00:05:40.757
My, my. You haven't changed in 15 years.

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.925
I guess that's 'cause
of your elven blood.

00:05:43.593 --> 00:05:45.136
A dark elf's blood.

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:49.390
Way back when.

00:05:50.433 --> 00:05:54.020
When I took you in after you got separated
from your tribe in the war.

00:05:54.103 --> 00:05:55.646
You were just a kid.

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:59.150
Did you really visit my dreams
just to talk about old times?

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:03.154
Remember, Darsh,
you and I are enemies now.

00:06:03.237 --> 00:06:05.615
Tell me. What do you really want?

00:06:06.783 --> 00:06:09.077
So your body isn't the only thing
that hasn't changed.

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:10.578
You're still bitchy, aren't you?

00:06:10.661 --> 00:06:13.164
In case you've forgotten,
I pretty much raised you.

00:06:13.247 --> 00:06:14.832
For 100 years I raised you.

00:06:14.916 --> 00:06:18.419
And look, you grew into an adult
with a ridiculously hot body!

00:06:20.963 --> 00:06:23.007
I love you, you know?

00:06:23.091 --> 00:06:26.594
So, don't go disobedient on me. Okay?

00:06:27.595 --> 00:06:30.348
I wouldn't want you
to turn into an enemy. You hear me?

00:06:30.431 --> 00:06:31.557
Stop!

00:06:31.641 --> 00:06:33.309
Good girl. Good girl.

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:38.272
You're trying to use my feelings
just to manipulate me again!

00:06:38.356 --> 00:06:40.983
Just like you did 15 years ago.

00:06:41.067 --> 00:06:43.319
You want me
wrapped around your little finger!

00:06:43.403 --> 00:06:44.529
I don't like where this is going.

00:06:44.612 --> 00:06:47.490
You beast!
You're nothing more than a pervert!

00:06:49.909 --> 00:06:52.703
Ow!

00:06:55.123 --> 00:06:56.207
Huh?

00:06:57.458 --> 00:07:00.586
You and I
were practically always together,

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:04.507
but you built that filthy harem of yours
and kept it secret from me!

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:06.676
Do you think
I'll ever let you forget that?

00:07:06.759 --> 00:07:09.011
You can't blame a guy
for wanting a harem!

00:07:09.095 --> 00:07:10.721
Oh, don't you even start!

00:07:13.516 --> 00:07:16.644
A command has been issued
to kill you, and I'll oblige!

00:07:16.727 --> 00:07:18.646
I'll make sure you never come back!

00:07:18.729 --> 00:07:21.607
Slayer, slayer! Oh, lightning of Balmor's!

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:24.610
Balbolt!

00:07:30.908 --> 00:07:33.035
-What's that?
-Empress Nei!

00:07:33.119 --> 00:07:34.245
It's Empress Nei!

00:07:34.328 --> 00:07:35.621
Sean Ari.

00:07:35.705 --> 00:07:37.832
Someone get Sean Ari, now!

00:07:37.915 --> 00:07:40.001
I am at your side, Empress Nei.

00:07:42.253 --> 00:07:44.881
You're aware of the order
to kill Dark Schneider?

00:07:44.964 --> 00:07:47.550
Regretfully, I'm unable
to leave my post at this time.

00:07:47.633 --> 00:07:49.177
So, you shall go in my place.

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:54.515
Sean Ari, as one of the Three Sorcerer
Generals serving me, Arshes Nei,

00:07:54.599 --> 00:07:58.311
you must use your powers
to kill Dark Schneider at all costs.

00:07:58.394 --> 00:08:01.481
Yes! As you wish, Empress Nei!

00:08:04.275 --> 00:08:07.278
Using that Illusion spell
to talk to Nei and win here over

00:08:07.361 --> 00:08:09.489
didn't really work out for you, did it?

00:08:09.572 --> 00:08:10.615
You made her mad.

00:08:10.698 --> 00:08:13.993
I wouldn't be surprised in the slightest
if she's laid some traps for you up ahead.

00:08:14.076 --> 00:08:16.787
Oh, like I'd really fall
for one of her traps? Give me a break!

00:08:16.871 --> 00:08:19.665
The girl was pretty crazy
about you 15 years ago.

00:08:19.749 --> 00:08:22.043
So that was likely a giant shock for her.

00:08:22.126 --> 00:08:26.088
I mean, can't we admit that a dark elf
and an evil wizard is a funny combination?

00:08:26.172 --> 00:08:27.131
Come on!

00:08:27.215 --> 00:08:28.508
Shut up!

00:08:28.591 --> 00:08:29.634
Ouch!

00:08:31.802 --> 00:08:34.722
And while we're at it,
why the hell are you following me, anyway?

00:08:34.805 --> 00:08:37.642
You would be better off
following Yoko or Gara.

00:08:38.726 --> 00:08:40.228
The rebels have attacked our castle.

00:08:40.311 --> 00:08:41.854
The Third Army seems to be leading them,

00:08:41.938 --> 00:08:44.857
so we need to get back there right now.

00:08:44.941 --> 00:08:45.816
Uh, of course.

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:46.817
I'll go as well.

00:08:48.861 --> 00:08:51.697
I couldn't just stand there
when I saw you sneak off

00:08:51.781 --> 00:08:53.574
away from the Princess' group.

00:08:53.658 --> 00:08:56.285
I thought it best to keep my eye on you.

00:08:56.369 --> 00:08:58.955
Damn you. Let's be clear about something.

00:08:59.038 --> 00:09:02.917
You being a small and pathetic animal
is the only reason I haven't killed you.

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.627
If you'd shown up in your previous form,

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:07.088
I would have
sliced you to pieces on the spot!

00:09:07.171 --> 00:09:08.631
So, if you don't mind,

00:09:08.714 --> 00:09:12.051
please be grateful to the handsome,
kind, and gentle Dark Schneider, okay?

00:09:14.971 --> 00:09:15.972
What's that about?

00:09:16.055 --> 00:09:18.808
I don't know. You seem different.
I can't quite put my finger on it.

00:09:18.891 --> 00:09:20.810
I am who I am.

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:22.186
Huh?

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:24.814
Help!

00:09:29.735 --> 00:09:30.736
The hell? A spider?

00:09:35.408 --> 00:09:37.410
Help me! Please help!

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:40.538
Wait! Dark Schneider!

00:09:40.621 --> 00:09:43.791
It's fishy to find a spider
in the mountains, right? 'Cause--

00:09:43.874 --> 00:09:46.002
Oh, don't you dare ruin it for me, Lars!

00:09:46.085 --> 00:09:49.797
I am a hero, a handsome one at that,
so there's only one thing to do.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:52.925
Seek and destroy,
oh spirit of the sinful inferno!

00:09:53.009 --> 00:09:55.761
Blood fire,
death into the Void!

00:10:11.986 --> 00:10:12.820
Wait.

00:10:12.903 --> 00:10:14.113
Talisman magic!

00:10:14.196 --> 00:10:17.408
The sorcerer who used it
to summon the spider must be nearby!

00:10:17.491 --> 00:10:20.911
So, High Ancient Magic.
One of the secret arts.

00:10:20.995 --> 00:10:22.913
I can't say that I was expecting this.

00:10:23.414 --> 00:10:27.168
Begs the question too,
who else, besides me, was capable of this?

00:10:27.251 --> 00:10:28.836
Who else could revive the lost art?

00:10:28.919 --> 00:10:30.004
Someone strong!

00:10:30.087 --> 00:10:31.047
Shut up!

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:33.424
This is nothing.
This magic's no match for me at all!

00:10:33.507 --> 00:10:35.635
-Um, excuse me.
-Huh?

00:10:36.427 --> 00:10:39.639
Thank you for saving me.
I'd like to repay you if I could.

00:10:39.722 --> 00:10:41.599
Hmm.

00:10:41.682 --> 00:10:42.933
Hmm?

00:10:43.434 --> 00:10:46.520
Mmm, indeed.

00:10:48.356 --> 00:10:50.191
Have you been traveling for a while?

00:10:50.274 --> 00:10:52.401
Yeah. Sort of, anyway.

00:10:52.485 --> 00:10:54.820
You must be tired
from walking all day,

00:10:54.904 --> 00:10:57.156
especially in a remote place like this.

00:10:57.239 --> 00:10:59.158
Well, conveniently, I live nearby.

00:10:59.241 --> 00:11:01.661
So would you like to rest
at my house for a bit?

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:07.750
We're in the middle of the mountains,
so it's not like we really have much here.

00:11:08.584 --> 00:11:09.960
But still, come on in.

00:11:10.044 --> 00:11:12.421
Um, I'll go ask them to make us some tea.

00:11:13.547 --> 00:11:14.507
Grandpa!

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:16.467
We have visitors!

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:17.468
Grandpa?

00:11:17.551 --> 00:11:20.388
She must be
a daughter of one of the local lords.

00:11:20.471 --> 00:11:22.473
You're acting cool,
but I know you too well.

00:11:22.556 --> 00:11:25.393
You're already thinking dirty,
perverted little thoughts, aren't you?

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:30.064
I know what kind of man you are,
Dark Schneider.

00:11:30.147 --> 00:11:31.565
And at the moment, you're thinking--

00:11:31.649 --> 00:11:32.692
Ouch!

00:11:42.952 --> 00:11:44.829
Uh…

00:11:46.288 --> 00:11:48.290
Thanks a lot for all the food.

00:11:48.874 --> 00:11:51.001
You've got a huge appetite.

00:11:51.085 --> 00:11:52.545
You're a big eater.

00:11:52.628 --> 00:11:54.463
Magic uses up a lot of energy,

00:11:54.547 --> 00:11:58.592
so I'll take whatever food
I can get my hands on.

00:11:58.676 --> 00:12:00.845
Along with any women, for that matter.

00:12:01.345 --> 00:12:02.972
What a disgusting perv--

00:12:03.055 --> 00:12:04.181
Ouch!

00:12:07.601 --> 00:12:10.855
Chew your food! It isn't that hard!

00:12:14.483 --> 00:12:15.943
B-by the way,

00:12:16.944 --> 00:12:21.073
just what brings you to the mountains
during these turbulent times?

00:12:21.657 --> 00:12:23.534
I certainly hope
it's not the fierce battle

00:12:23.617 --> 00:12:25.703
going on at Meta-llicana Castle.

00:12:26.871 --> 00:12:30.374
Well, I've just got
some family business to handle.

00:12:30.958 --> 00:12:34.128
You see, one of my family members
pulled a stupid, little prank.

00:12:34.211 --> 00:12:37.757
Since someone has to clean up after her,
I figured that I would do it.

00:12:39.675 --> 00:12:40.801
Hey.

00:12:40.885 --> 00:12:44.054
You know,
this region is under Nei's control.

00:12:44.138 --> 00:12:47.475
But despite that, the people living
in this mansion haven't run away.

00:12:47.558 --> 00:12:50.102
They're still living here in peace.
Don't you think that's--

00:12:50.186 --> 00:12:52.062
Oh, shut up, Lars.

00:12:52.146 --> 00:12:55.775
Even if something does happen,
I'm the handsome, young hero here.

00:12:55.858 --> 00:12:57.401
So it's not like they're gonna beat me.

00:12:59.111 --> 00:12:59.945
Huh?

00:13:08.537 --> 00:13:11.415
Dark Schneider,
are you seeing this!

00:13:15.336 --> 00:13:16.921
Excuse me, Dark Schneider.

00:13:17.004 --> 00:13:19.089
I don't mean to bother you,
but are you asleep?

00:13:19.173 --> 00:13:21.801
Not at all. I'm still wide awake.

00:13:22.802 --> 00:13:25.387
M-my family has a tradition.

00:13:25.471 --> 00:13:28.057
When someone saves
an unwed daughter of ours,

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:31.227
well, we give him her vir-- her virginity,

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:33.145
and the family attends to his needs.

00:13:33.229 --> 00:13:35.022
Is that okay? Uh…

00:13:35.105 --> 00:13:36.941
Well, that sounds good to me.

00:13:37.024 --> 00:13:38.526
What a noble tradition, huh?

00:13:40.319 --> 00:13:42.947
No! It's a trap!
Don't do it, Dark Schneider--

00:13:44.198 --> 00:13:45.950
That hurt.

00:13:51.831 --> 00:13:54.166
Pl-please be gentle with me.

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:55.125
Okay?

00:13:56.126 --> 00:13:57.545
I know. I know.

00:14:08.472 --> 00:14:09.640
Oh, not there!

00:14:15.062 --> 00:14:17.648
Dark Schneider, please don't hurt me!

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:20.818
Don't worry, now.

00:14:21.402 --> 00:14:24.029
<i>She's got marks on her skin</i>
<i>from wearing armor.</i>

00:14:27.283 --> 00:14:28.117
What?

00:14:34.748 --> 00:14:37.001
Looks like you fell for it,
Dark Schneider!

00:14:37.084 --> 00:14:40.880
And unfortunately for you,
that spider never lets go of it's prey.

00:14:40.963 --> 00:14:44.008
Too bad that talisman I put on you
neutralizes magic.

00:14:44.091 --> 00:14:46.760
You're as helpless as a newborn baby now!

00:14:47.344 --> 00:14:48.470
Dark Schneider! Oh no!

00:14:48.554 --> 00:14:50.347
You're an assassin?

00:14:50.431 --> 00:14:53.350
I'm actually one of
the most powerful sorcerers in the world.

00:14:53.434 --> 00:14:56.478
One of the Three Sorcerer Generals,
Sean Ari.

00:14:56.562 --> 00:15:00.065
It seems you were unable to resist
the temptations of a willing virgin,

00:15:00.149 --> 00:15:02.568
despite being strong enough
to defeat Ninja Master Gara.

00:15:02.651 --> 00:15:04.069
Does that sound about right?

00:15:04.153 --> 00:15:06.071
You use Talisman Magic?

00:15:06.155 --> 00:15:07.072
You don't fool me.

00:15:07.156 --> 00:15:10.326
I know you're not powerful enough
to resurrect the High Ancient Magic alone.

00:15:10.409 --> 00:15:12.077
So tell me, who helps you?

00:15:12.161 --> 00:15:13.954
Hmm. How very perceptive.

00:15:14.038 --> 00:15:15.581
I suppose I can tell you.

00:15:16.081 --> 00:15:17.791
One of the Four Generals,

00:15:17.875 --> 00:15:21.503
known as the Empress of Thunder,
Empress Arshes Nei!

00:15:22.296 --> 00:15:23.380
<i>Nei?</i>

00:15:23.881 --> 00:15:26.175
<i>She's powerful enough to do that?</i>

00:15:26.258 --> 00:15:28.135
Say goodbye, lady-killer!

00:15:29.678 --> 00:15:33.182
Talisman Magic!
Ritual Spider, devour him!

00:15:39.813 --> 00:15:40.856
I did it!

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:44.860
Everyone said you were invincible,
but I defeated you all by myself!

00:15:44.944 --> 00:15:47.071
Empress Nei will be overjoyed
by this news!

00:15:47.154 --> 00:15:48.739
-That's amazing!
-Huh?

00:15:49.323 --> 00:15:52.201
That was amazing!
Really hot stuff!

00:15:52.284 --> 00:15:54.244
There are few things hotter in this world

00:15:54.328 --> 00:15:56.747
than watching a virgin
shake her juicy ass.

00:15:56.830 --> 00:15:58.582
D-Dark Schneider?

00:16:00.084 --> 00:16:02.586
How could… But then who's that over there?

00:16:05.506 --> 00:16:06.966
An Illusion spell?

00:16:07.049 --> 00:16:08.092
Exactly right.

00:16:10.803 --> 00:16:14.807
<i>That spell. It's the same one</i>
<i>he used when fighting before.</i>

00:16:17.601 --> 00:16:19.478
Hold it right there.

00:16:20.813 --> 00:16:21.689
Huh?

00:16:22.982 --> 00:16:25.484
Wha… what the…?
Isn't the spell still…

00:16:30.072 --> 00:16:30.906
Huh?

00:16:32.408 --> 00:16:34.743
The Illusion spell is still going on.

00:16:34.827 --> 00:16:37.621
So, come on. Can you tell
where the spell first started?

00:16:37.705 --> 00:16:40.666
How did you do it?
When did you cast the spell?

00:16:40.749 --> 00:16:42.418
Before you stuck the talisman on me.

00:16:42.501 --> 00:16:45.796
<i>I heard Dark Schneider</i>
<i>was just a horny playboy.</i>

00:16:45.879 --> 00:16:47.631
<i>I thought my plan was perfect!</i>

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:51.844
How long? How could you have known?

00:16:51.927 --> 00:16:53.846
Tough luck, sweet cheeks.

00:16:53.929 --> 00:16:56.390
Nothing ever escapes my detection.

00:16:56.473 --> 00:16:57.808
I knew about it all along.

00:16:57.891 --> 00:16:59.018
Like hell you did!

00:16:59.101 --> 00:17:02.146
It was only 'cause of the marks left
by her armor, right?

00:17:02.229 --> 00:17:05.816
But why, though? Why didn't you kill me
when you had the chance?

00:17:05.899 --> 00:17:08.110
And you had plenty of chances,
Dark Schneider!

00:17:08.193 --> 00:17:10.612
Curiosity. You weren't entirely wrong.

00:17:10.696 --> 00:17:12.823
I was curious
about what a virgin could do.

00:17:13.574 --> 00:17:15.492
And because you're so beautiful.

00:17:18.037 --> 00:17:20.998
Me? You think I'm beautiful?

00:17:21.874 --> 00:17:24.460
But I've been trying this whole time
to murder you.

00:17:24.543 --> 00:17:25.836
I'm your enemy.

00:17:27.546 --> 00:17:29.715
Doesn't matter. You're still beautiful.

00:17:36.013 --> 00:17:40.809
<i>Empress Nei granted special magical powers</i>
<i>to each of the Three Sorcerer Generals,</i>

00:17:40.893 --> 00:17:43.771
<i>so powerful that even our allies fear us.</i>

00:17:43.854 --> 00:17:44.897
<i>Because of that,</i>

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:48.609
<i>no one has ever afforded me any kind words</i>
<i>before in my life.</i>

00:17:49.568 --> 00:17:55.407
<i>But you… you're the first man</i>
<i>who ever told me that I'm beautiful.</i>

00:17:56.784 --> 00:17:57.618
<i>I… </i>

00:17:58.327 --> 00:18:00.954
<i>I… I…</i>

00:18:03.499 --> 00:18:05.959
Don't worry.
I'll be good to you.

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:07.294
Come on.

00:18:22.684 --> 00:18:25.187
This is a shonen manga!

00:18:32.694 --> 00:18:35.322
You know, you're really not
like how I imagined you would be.

00:18:35.405 --> 00:18:36.365
Not at all.

00:18:36.448 --> 00:18:39.326
Oh, really? You said I'm just a horny guy.

00:18:39.409 --> 00:18:40.702
Turns out you called it right.

00:18:40.786 --> 00:18:43.372
You can't go any further beyond here.

00:18:43.455 --> 00:18:45.457
Empress Nei is truly terrifying.

00:18:45.541 --> 00:18:48.168
She's absolutely determined to kill you.

00:18:48.252 --> 00:18:49.628
And you should know,

00:18:49.711 --> 00:18:52.172
there's another assassin
waiting for you up ahead.

00:18:52.256 --> 00:18:53.757
One of the Three Sorcerer Generals

00:18:53.841 --> 00:18:56.552
to whom Empress Nei granted
the most powerful magic.

00:18:57.136 --> 00:19:01.265
I don't even come close
to matching the level of power they have.

00:19:02.808 --> 00:19:03.934
Imagine that.

00:19:04.017 --> 00:19:06.353
Don't go! You could die!

00:19:06.436 --> 00:19:07.729
Please, Dark Schneider!

00:19:09.773 --> 00:19:10.774
W-wait!

00:19:11.358 --> 00:19:13.527
Don't go! I beg you!

00:19:14.653 --> 00:19:16.071
I don't want you to die!

00:19:16.822 --> 00:19:19.491
You were my first,
and I want to see you again.

00:19:21.785 --> 00:19:24.037
When the marks from your armor are gone,

00:19:24.121 --> 00:19:27.082
I'll make you feel even better
than I did last night.

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:31.712
See you later.

00:19:39.386 --> 00:19:41.972
This isn't how I wanted
to meet you, Dark Schneider.

00:19:43.432 --> 00:19:45.100
Oh, Dark Schneider.

00:19:45.601 --> 00:19:47.769
I wish we weren't enemies.

00:19:47.853 --> 00:19:50.939
<i>I wish you were the one</i>
<i>who ruled us instead.</i>

00:19:52.441 --> 00:19:55.485
Hey! Dark Schneider! So did you do it?

00:19:55.569 --> 00:19:58.113
Did you go all the way?
Come on! What happened?

00:19:58.197 --> 00:20:00.199
-Shut up!
-Ouch!

00:20:04.745 --> 00:20:08.415
<i>If only.</i>
<i>Literally, all I did was bite her ear.</i>

00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:17.341
<i>Things just aren't</i>
<i>working out my way.</i>

00:20:19.051 --> 00:20:21.762
<i>I was close. Damn!</i>

00:20:26.016 --> 00:20:26.975
Empress Nei!

00:20:27.559 --> 00:20:30.896
We've received word that Sean Ari
has fallen to Dark Schneider.

00:20:30.979 --> 00:20:31.813
I see.

00:20:32.481 --> 00:20:36.193
<i>I guess Talisman magic</i>
<i>isn't strong enough to defeat Darsh.</i>

00:20:36.693 --> 00:20:39.905
So then, are you saying Sean is dead?

00:20:39.988 --> 00:20:41.657
Well, Empress…

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:42.991
Out with it!

00:20:43.075 --> 00:20:47.246
Uh, well, the… the reports say
she let Dark Schneider escape.

00:20:47.329 --> 00:20:48.747
and then disappeared herself.

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:50.165
She what?

00:20:50.249 --> 00:20:51.416
<i>No!</i>

00:20:52.125 --> 00:20:54.127
<i>Darsh seduced her, didn't he?</i>

00:20:55.295 --> 00:20:57.005
<i>He was always like that!</i>

00:20:57.089 --> 00:20:59.424
<i>Seducing friend and foe alike.</i>

00:20:59.508 --> 00:21:01.510
<i>He'd take anyone</i>
<i>he could get his hands on.</i>

00:21:02.094 --> 00:21:03.262
Bastard!

00:21:03.345 --> 00:21:06.598
<i>You're a curse to women everywhere!</i>

00:21:06.682 --> 00:21:09.559
Even sure things
aren't sure things these days.

00:22:41.109 --> 00:22:43.528
Looks like we finally arrived.

00:22:44.363 --> 00:22:46.365
Dark Schneider, what are you thinking?

00:22:46.448 --> 00:22:50.660
You realize Meta-llicana castle
is under attack, even as we speak, right?

00:22:50.744 --> 00:22:52.329
I told you already.

00:22:52.412 --> 00:22:54.039
I'm trying to clean up after a prank

00:22:54.122 --> 00:22:56.333
that a disappointing family member
tried to pull.

00:22:56.416 --> 00:22:58.126
-Huh?
-What's wrong?

00:22:58.710 --> 00:23:00.545
-Look over there.
-Hmm?

00:23:00.629 --> 00:23:03.715
Statues? What are they doing there?

00:23:04.216 --> 00:23:05.884
Wait. I know what it is!

00:23:05.967 --> 00:23:08.595
Medusa's our next foe!
The snake lady, right?

00:23:10.389 --> 00:23:12.516
Dumb ass!

00:23:13.183 --> 00:23:14.768
Hey! You!

00:23:14.851 --> 00:23:15.977
Who's there?

00:23:17.145 --> 00:23:19.815
You're the bastard
Dark Schneider I take it?

00:23:19.898 --> 00:23:22.109
I-it's Medusa!

00:23:22.776 --> 00:23:25.487
Cover your eyes, Dark Schneider!
She'll turn you to stone!

00:23:25.570 --> 00:23:27.280
Out of my way!

00:23:27.364 --> 00:23:28.448
Who are you?

00:23:30.951 --> 00:23:33.161
I'm an attendant of Empress Nei.

00:23:36.915 --> 00:23:39.501
One of the Three Sorcerer Generals,
Kai Harn!

00:23:40.001 --> 00:23:41.878
Thus, by the order of the Empress,

00:23:42.546 --> 00:23:44.047
I'm going to kill you.

00:23:44.756 --> 00:23:46.425
Oh.

00:23:46.508 --> 00:23:48.927
So they're sending a pretty boy this time?
